":"穆叔","kind":"person","person_id":"18r_wn6_nhh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m072-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"pzz_h6y_gwp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m072-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"母弟","kind":"person","person_id":"rur_xf3_opk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m072-0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"裯","kind":"person","person_id":"cp2_vf3_igr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m072-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"季氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未指名者、論贊署稱、地點氏稱或未定指代；不補姓名、爵位與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m072-0076","start":76,"end":79,"surface":"季武子","kind":"person","person_id":"nvt_gxa_pdo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m072-0094","start":94,"end":96,"surface":"君子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未指名者、論贊署稱、地點氏稱或未定指代；不補姓名、爵位與成員。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","book_id":"b-shiji-033","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p073","text":"昭公三年，朝晉至河，晉平公謝還之，魯恥焉。四年，楚靈王會諸矦於申，昭公稱病不往。七年，季武子卒。八年，楚靈王就章華臺，召昭公。昭公往賀，賜昭公寶器；已而悔，復詐取之。十二年，朝晉至河，晉平公謝還之。十三年，楚公子棄疾弒其君靈王，代立。十五年，朝晉，晉留之葬晉昭公，魯恥之。二十年，齊景公與晏子狩竟，因入魯問禮。二十一年，朝晉至河，晉謝還之。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m073-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"cp2_vf3_igr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m073-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"晉平公","kind":"person","person_id":"0p8_ug5_eja","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m073-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"楚靈王","kind":"person","person_id":"glu_u6e_lf4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m073-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"cp2_vf3_igr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m073-0043","start":43,"end":46,"surface":"季武子","kind":"person","person_id":"nvt_gxa_pdo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m073-0051","start":51,"end":54,"surface":"楚靈王","kind":"person","person_id":"glu_u6e_lf4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m073-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"cp2_vf3_igr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m073-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"cp2_vf3_igr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m073-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"cp2_vf3_igr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m073-0092","start":92,"end":95,"surface":"晉平公","kind":"person","person_id":"0p8_ug5_eja","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m073-0103","start":103,"end":108,"surface":"楚公子棄疾","kind":"person","person_id":"q8m_d0c_kq3_AE","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m073-0111","start":111,"end":113,"surface":"靈王","kind":"person","person_id":"glu_u6e_lf4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m073-0128","start":128,"end":131,"surface":"晉昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"0ad_dbw_97q","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m073-0140","start":140,"end":143,"surface":"齊景公","kind":"person","person_id":"wuz_yxe_b9k","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m073-0144","start":144,"end":146,"surface":"晏子","kind":"person","person_id":"jcn_rp4_qap","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","book_id":"b-shiji-033","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p078","text":"定公立，趙簡子問史墨曰：『季氏亡乎？』史墨對曰：『不亡。季友有大功於魯，受鄪爲上卿，至于文子、武子，世增其業。魯文公卒，東門遂殺適立庶，魯君於是失國政。政在季氏，於今四君矣。民不知君，何以得國！是以爲君慎器與名，不可以假人。』","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m078-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"定公","kind